      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786634406417,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "everything above is ONE of 8 parallel jobs.\nThe split is OUR engineering, purely for speed\n(38 h serial → ~13 h). Graphiti is unaware of it.",
